3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,360
They were going to school soon.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,120
She bought a pink one and a blue

5
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:11,480
one.

6
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,860
She drove back home.

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,220
Girls, I have something for you, her mom

8
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:18,720
