9
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:22,220
Sarah and Barbara ran to her.

10
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:23,780
What is it?

11
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,060
Sarah asked.

12
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,920
She showed them the water bottles.

13
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,900
They both grabbed the pink one.

14
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,480
They started pulling it.

15
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:37,180
I grabbed it first, Barbara said.

16
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,300
No, I did, Sarah argued.

17
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,660
The mom did not know what to do.

18
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,640
She thought one of them would like the

19
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,300
