20
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,180
She could just flip a coin.

21
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,280
One of them would still be mad though.

22
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,920
Donna decided not to give the water bottle

23
